# Substring / extended-regex patterns for Unity -logFile lines that are known-benign under
# -batchmode -nographics (or dedicated-server) smoke runs. One pattern per line; blank lines
# and # comments ignored. Used by triage_run.sh — NOT by run_smoketest.sh yet (harness still
# fails hard on any Exception:; keep this list honest so triage can say "noise-only fail").
#
# Only add a pattern after confirming it is not masking a real regression. Prefer fixing the
# source (e.g. skip icon gen in batchmode) over growing this list.

Blitter is already initialized
Attempting to create a graphics buffer that requires compute shader support
RenderTexture\.Create failed
Trying to access a shader but no shaders were included in the build
Built-in Resource Error:
The referenced script on this Behaviour \(Game Object 'OxygenConsumerSystem'\) is missing!
There can be only one active Event System
Unable to load font asset
OnGUI function detected
Discord
TMP SubMesh
Shader warning
